# Every committed file is LF in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# The skill body is read and hashed by the test suite, so a line-ending rewrite on
# checkout would fail the tests on Windows for a reason that has nothing to do
# with the plugin. LF is the only setting that keeps the tree identical everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files must never be line-ending translated or merged.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary